  "title": "Almond Tortoni",
  "description": "A light, fluffy frozen almond mousse, studded with almonds and red and green cherries. These are really easy to make and, their flavor improves if they're made a few weeks in advance, and stored in the freezer.",
  "authors": [
    "dakota kelly"
